\p{Every corpus with one worker, where the machine's counters do not depend on scheduling, \code{\verb~|--threads 1 --stats -X stats-file=F~}, through five launchers: the published executable, the hybrid executable with \code{\verb~|--platform image~}, without an option, with \code{\verb~|--platform jvm~} (handed over to Temurin 25), and the JVM launcher of the hybrid distribution. Compared, key by key, is every value of the statistics file that is not a time: the machine's counters (ticks, records, run words, pairs, calls and hits by kind, probes, declines, resets), the reference engine's, the driver's and the loader's.}

